OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1786279672
OL,3,CBus drivers stage rally outside
OL,4,CTransport for London offices
OL,6,FLondon bus drivers have staged a rally
OL,7,Foutside Transport for London's
OL,8,FPalestra offices, in Southwark,
OL,9,Fdemanding a Bill of Rights.
OL,11,FThe rally was organised by individual
OL,12,Fbus drivers, and took place
OL,13,Findependently of any unions.
OL,15,FThe Bus Drivers' Bill of Rights is a
OL,16,Flist of demands, made up of twelve
OL,17,Fpoints, including having functioning
OL,18,Fheating and air conditioning in cabs,
OL,19,Fproper rest breaks and serviced toilet
OL,20,Ffacilities on all routes.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G1/5
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
