OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,379,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37802
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1786279672
OL,3,CBus drivers stage rally outside
OL,4,CTransport for London offices
OL,6,FLast month, London Assembly members at
OL,7,FCity Hall unanimously approved a
OL,8,Fmotion to bring the Bill of Rights
OL,9,Finto effect.
OL,11,F"We're here today to embarass the man
OL,12,Fat the top, Sir Sadiq Khan, into
OL,13,Fgetting behind this," said Keith
OL,14,FPrince, a Reform UK London Assembly
OL,15,Fmember.
OL,17,FHe added: "It's so important as these
OL,18,Fare basic human rights - it must be a
OL,19,Fbasic human right to go to the toilet
OL,20,Fat the end of a bus route.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G2/5
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,379,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37803
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1786279672
OL,3,CBus drivers stage rally outside
OL,4,CTransport for London offices
OL,6,F"It can't be right that you're in a
OL,7,Fcab that's overheated or freezing cold
OL,8,F- we're not in Victorian times."
OL,10,FThe rally comes after investigations
OL,11,Ffrom ITV News London, which found that
OL,12,Fbus drivers have worked in 44'C cabs,
OL,13,Fand felt they needed to self-dehydrate
OL,14,Fand urinate in jars due to a lack of
OL,15,Ftoilet facilities.
OL,17,FSir Sadiq Khan, the Mayor of London,
OL,18,Fbranded these findings "unacceptable"
OL,19,Flast week.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G3/5
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
