FL,379,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37805
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1786279672
OL,3,CBus drivers stage rally outside
OL,4,CTransport for London offices
OL,6,F"We regularly engage with Unite the
OL,7,FUnion on these matters. We are working
OL,8,Ftogether on a range of measures to
OL,9,Ffurther improve working conditions,
OL,10,Fhealth and wellbeing. We are committed
OL,11,Fto ensuring that all staff have a fair
OL,12,Fwork schedule, with safe vehicles and
OL,13,Faccess to the facilities they need to
OL,14,Fcarry out their roles effectively.
OL,16,F"We would like to reassure colleagues
OL,17,Fagain that any reports from drivers
OL,18,Fare always fully investigated, and our
OL,19,Foperators should never take action
OL,20,Fagainst people raising concerns about
OL,21,Fwelfare."
OL,26,@nD@AOUxD@AOU
